[?2004l[?2004h>     log('%s cd4 thr %.1f (%s %s) cd8 thr %.1f (%s %s) -> CD4 %d CD8 %d DP %d DN %d' % (name, t_cd4, m7, b7, t_cd8, m8, b8, CD4T.sum(), CD8T.sum(), DPT.sum(), DNT.sum()))
